    test(orchbee): drain close-lease acknowledgement in UiDriver close-family test
    
    CommandMailbox::finish_lease records a CloseLeaseAcknowledgement for every
    close-family lease and refuses a second one while the previous is still
    held. Production NativeUi::tick consumes the acknowledgement each tick via
    take_close_acknowledgement + acknowledge_close_lease; the native harness
    UiDriver deposits replies without ticking, so the first lease's
    acknowledgement survived into the second finish_lease and closed the
    mailbox as Protocol (~5% race vs the test's own close(Closed)).
    
    Drain and assert the exact acknowledgement after the first lease's reply
    is received, mirroring the production hand-off ordering. No production
    code touched.
    
